{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/673cda7c44e64b23c729c09b5a57a8a7.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/673cda7c44e64b23c729c09b5a57a8a7.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were hired to deliver a package to a famous archaeologist on a remote isle. One shipwreck later, you arrived at the island of Meridiem face-down, booty-up, soaked, and sore all over. Today\u2019s delivery may require you to perform some tasks that fall outside of your normal job description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/e789b269bd1f78199a0d8a96057a89a1.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/e789b269bd1f78199a0d8a96057a89a1.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peruse Meridiem\u2019s beautiful beaches, intimidating cliffs, curious caves, haunting ruins, and the horrifically grimy Saltwater Motel. In this densely-packed, tiny open world, secrets are hiding everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/17ec8d0fd93bb3ade3e16d22abe31eb4.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/17ec8d0fd93bb3ade3e16d22abe31eb4.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a time share from sleazy salesman Gus. Offend the nasal palate of world-class perfumier Chauncey. Rave it up with Eurodance luminary DJ Cool Bass. And PLEASE! Do NOT join Stew\u2019s cult! \u2026unless?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/11187392ae9848da40e40eea0f8e6914.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/11187392ae9848da40e40eea0f8e6914.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to think outside the <span class=\"bb_strike\">box</span> clocks as you observe and unravel timeful conundrums. Use convenient tools to automatically capture and store information, ensuring you never miss (or forget) an important detail. Utilize hints and accessibility tools to scale puzzle difficulty to your liking. Mull over your notes, dream up inventive solutions, execute carefully-timed strategies, and unlock new abilities and locations. Or fail! Failing is an option too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/8d3110748d8e1b6c6d4b5aa17dc8ab58.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/8d3110748d8e1b6c6d4b5aa17dc8ab58.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the loop? Is this loop escapable at all? Are you stuck on this island forever!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOAH WOAH, calm down! Take a breath! It\u2019ll all be alright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just explore some structures, solve some puzzles, chat with some goofballs, and push your existential dread into that deep, dark corner in the back of your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2052710?t=1762873261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762873261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/30e2f523f92ef4d89529d241c14bba4dbd4d8b4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762873261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/30e2f523f92ef4d89529d241c14bba4dbd4d8b4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762873261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/673cda7c44e64b23c729c09b5a57a8a7.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/673cda7c44e64b23c729c09b5a57a8a7.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were hired to deliver a package to a famous archaeologist on a remote isle. One shipwreck later, you arrived at the island of Meridiem face-down, booty-up, soaked, and sore all over. Today\u2019s delivery may require you to perform some tasks that fall outside of your normal job description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/e789b269bd1f78199a0d8a96057a89a1.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/e789b269bd1f78199a0d8a96057a89a1.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peruse Meridiem\u2019s beautiful beaches, intimidating cliffs, curious caves, haunting ruins, and the horrifically grimy Saltwater Motel. In this densely-packed, tiny open world, secrets are hiding everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/17ec8d0fd93bb3ade3e16d22abe31eb4.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/17ec8d0fd93bb3ade3e16d22abe31eb4.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a time share from sleazy salesman Gus. Offend the nasal palate of world-class perfumier Chauncey. Rave it up with Eurodance luminary DJ Cool Bass. And PLEASE! Do NOT join Stew\u2019s cult! \u2026unless?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/11187392ae9848da40e40eea0f8e6914.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/11187392ae9848da40e40eea0f8e6914.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to think outside the <span class=\"bb_strike\">box</span> clocks as you observe and unravel timeful conundrums. Use convenient tools to automatically capture and store information, ensuring you never miss (or forget) an important detail. Utilize hints and accessibility tools to scale puzzle difficulty to your liking. Mull over your notes, dream up inventive solutions, execute carefully-timed strategies, and unlock new abilities and locations. Or fail! Failing is an option too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/8d3110748d8e1b6c6d4b5aa17dc8ab58.poster.avif?t=1762873261\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/extras/8d3110748d8e1b6c6d4b5aa17dc8ab58.webm?t=1762873261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the loop? Is this loop escapable at all? Are you stuck on this island forever!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOAH WOAH, calm down! Take a breath! It\u2019ll all be alright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just explore some structures, solve some puzzles, chat with some goofballs, and push your existential dread into that deep, dark corner in the back of your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Soup Island"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052710/2e4e542829afdc7f695e69956a02098ae61382b6/header.jpg?t=1762873261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2052710/872176/066ff7b598938e9915